  "mainEntity": {
    "name": "What Affects the Cost of a Kitchen Renovation in San Diego County?",
    "text": "What Affects the Cost of a Kitchen Renovation in San Diego County?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "The cost of a kitchen renovation depends on the layout, structural changes, plumbing and electrical work, cabinetry, countertops, appliances, finishes, permitting needs, and site conditions. A proposal becomes more useful when it separates design, construction, materials, allowances, and exclusions instead of presenting one unexplained total. Compare scope and assumptions, not just price.",
